# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# aviti-tools — repository-wide ignore rules
#
# Created by Stephane Plaisance — VIB Nucleomics Core
# Date: 2026-07-25
#
# Per-project rules live in their own .gitignore (e.g. aviti_test_mask/.gitignore);
# this file holds rules that apply across the whole repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Bulk AVITI thumbnail image sets and batch QC output.
# These are large binary PNG collections (hundreds of files, >600 MB) that are
# kept on local/NAS storage only and deliberately not version-controlled.
#
# One worked example IS tracked so the QC scripts stay runnable from a clean
# clone: run V242402_4409_6_ThumbnailLane2 keeps both its input thumbnails
# (below) and its output under aviti_thumbnail_QC/QC_results_one/.
# Note the "dir/*" form — git will not descend into a fully-excluded directory,
# so negations only take effect when the contents (not the dir) are excluded.
aviti_thumbnail_QC/aviti_thumbnails/*
!aviti_thumbnail_QC/aviti_thumbnails/V242402_4409_6_ThumbnailLane1.png
!aviti_thumbnail_QC/aviti_thumbnails/V242402_4409_6_ThumbnailLane2.png

aviti_thumbnail_QC/QC_results_all/

# Stale pre-rename copy of the above (renamed to aviti_thumbnail_QC/ on develop)
thumbnail_QC/aviti_thumbnails/

# Thumbnail archives staged for transfer — these run to hundreds of MB each and
# belong on local/NAS storage, never in git history.
measure_thumbnails/*.tar
*.tar.gz

# Working data pulled down by get_aviti_thumbnails.sh — the untarred thumbnail
# set (~363 MB of PNGs). Regenerate by re-running the script; only the script
# itself is tracked.
get_aviti_thumbnails/Data/

# macOS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*

# Python bytecode and test caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
